            "# A minimal grass-funded research controller.\ndef afford(cost):\n    if cost == None:\n        return False\n    for item in cost:\n        if num_items(item) < cost[item]:\n            return False\n    return True\nwhile num_unlocked(Unlocks.Speed) < 3:\n    if can_harvest():\n        harvest()\n    if afford(get_cost(Unlocks.Speed)):\n        unlock(Unlocks.Speed)",
